I went to high school like 200 years ago.

21
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:26,920
So when I was in elementary school, you know, grade 1, grade 2, grade 3, what's going on?

22
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,640
Grade 1, grade 2, grade 3.

23
