50
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,840
And all the reading research will show that.

51
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:37,040
But it's because they have to fit the kids in to the traditional program.

52
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:41,020
Well, at Wilson, kids had 12 years to learn to read.

53
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,150
