56
00:03:46,770 --> 00:03:52,680
But there wasn't first grade reading class out of Scott Forsman's textbook, you know.

57
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:53,700
We put all in the basement.

58
00:03:53,700 --> 00:04:06,760
And so then what's missing from the Minnesota State right now is the research, experimentation,

59
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:11,880
innovation, challenging new ideas, trying things differently.

60
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:15,220
So when I got in trouble with the legislature and called them ranking links,

61
