64
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:29,440
And we're going to go ahead and do it.

65
00:04:30,030 --> 00:04:31,530
I'm supporting them, you see.

66
00:04:32,710 --> 00:04:34,410
That's the kind of thing that we have.

67
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,350
We don't have that now.

68
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:38,530
And we need that kind of spirit.

69
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:44,470
